  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Drive a genuine configurable articulated road train (three trailers by
    default) with native axle contact and physical articulated hitches. Hold ACTION
    to brake every trailer independently of the tractor. Longest Safe Convoy banks
    controlled travel with the entire selected train attached. Obstacle Race requires
    your last trailer to pass the three numbered alternating freight gates, then
    stop the whole train at your marked depot. Orange roadblocks are real movable
    obstacles: clipping them can damage cargo or break a link. Gate shortcuts never
    qualify for delivery; speed and actual cargo condition decide the result. Maximum
    Trailer Challenge requires delivering the full configured length goal; losing
    a link fails that goal. Its actual length is bounded by this venue''s authored
    native-trailer capacity. Successful delivered count dominates ranking, followed
    by cargo preservation and time. The Inspector selects normal train length and
    the Maximum Challenge length independently. Survival banks actual moving, supported
    survival time and ends when any link is lost. Detached trailers never count.
    A delivery requires the last connected trailer stopped at your depot and the
    whole connected train settled.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
